@startuml

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

autonumber

actor "Player" as Player
participant ":System" as System

activate Player

    Player -> System : Requests list of available maps
    activate System

    System --> Player : Displays list of available maps

    System --> Player : Requests selected map

    Player -> System : Selects a map

    System --> Player : Displays selected map
    deactivate System

    Player -> System : Selects location for the station
    activate System

    System --> Player : Requests station type (Depot, Station, Terminal)

    Player -> System : Provides station type (*not enough budget*)

    System --> Player : Shows error message "Not enough budget to build the station, please try again later."
    deactivate System

@enduml
